717 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 306 0 R
/T (Using a score frozen on 1 Feb 2025, High tier customers applied again by June 36.3% vs 12.4% for Low tier. Frequency and product breadth drive this ranking, and equal weights give almost the same result \(AUC 0.653 vs 0.649\), so it does not depend on our chosen weights.)
